=> Caching system :
hello-1.0.0/
Pizza-1.0.0/


1) Create .lock
hello-1.0.0/
Pizza-1.0.0/
.lock


2) Prefix all old apis with a '.'
.hello-1.0.0/
.Pizza-1.0.0/
.lock


3) Refresh normally (without the purge_directory)
.hello-1.0.0/
hello-1.0.0/
.Pizza-1.0.0/
.lock


4.1) If there is any failure
.hello-1.0.0/
.Pizza-1.0.0/
.lock

Remove the '.' prefix
hello-1.0.0/
Pizza-1.0.0/
.lock

Finally delete the .lock
hello-1.0.0/
Pizza-1.0.0/


4.2) If all goes well
.hello-1.0.0/
.Pizza-1.0.0/
hello-1.0.0/
Pizza-1.0.0/
.lock

Delete the '.' prefix
hello-1.0.0/
Pizza-1.0.0/
.lock

Finally delete the .lock
hello-1.0.0/
Pizza-1.0.0/
